  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Luck of Heroes",
    "definition_type_raw": "Hero Point",
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Player's Guide pg. 324",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Player's Guide pg. 324\nTo others, it seems that you always have a bit of luck around you.\n\nPrerequisites: Hero’s Fortune.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you spend a hero point to reroll a die roll or to grant yourself a bonus before a die roll is made, there is a chance that the hero point is not spent. Whenever you spend a hero point, roll a d20. If the result is greater than 15, the hero point is not spent. You cannot use this feat when you cheat death.",
